      "title": "Alerts in a max-priority heap",
      "description": "### Alerts in a max-priority heap\n\n**DSA topic:** 9. Binary heap (priority queue)\n\nHigher severity first; equal severity → older first. Overdue shipments are found first (`sweepOverdue`)."
