      "title": "Heap push (sift up) and pop (sift down)",
      "description": "### Heap push (sift up) and pop (sift down)\n\n**DSA topic:** 9. Binary heap (priority queue)\n\nChildren of index i are 2i+1 and 2i+2. Push and pop are O(log n), and the most urgent alert is always at index 0."
